# Check text out with LF on every platform.
#
# Several tests compare checked-in files byte-for-byte against generated
# output (the plugin-API site reference, the guides' synced blocks, the
# crate map) or scan sources for `\n#[cfg(test)]\n`. With git's Windows
# default (`core.autocrlf=true`) the checkout gets CRLF and every one of
# them fails on content that is, in fact, current.
* text=auto eol=lf
